      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "When you adopt the Mac idiom, thoroughly audit your app’s layout, and plan to make changes to it",
      "section_path": [
        "Mac Catalyst",
        "Choose an idiom"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "5219d7580b3dbb9107f7a70abff1081620ba2608f40d7f078022d4e8a97b960c",
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "Adjust font sizes as needed",
      "section_path": [
        "Mac Catalyst",
        "Choose an idiom"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "10d8e15095c1994f4b87ce3c9ccc081333d84401b3b2c6559454150abae2b7fb",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Make sure views and images look good in the Mac version of your app",
      "section_path": [
        "Mac Catalyst",
        "Choose an idiom"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "eb10c666c1a0d151df4270f92e5a2c6caf5357be2ca74408453dd8cd015e8d26",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "Limit your appearance customizations to standard macOS appearance customizations that are the same or similar to those available in",
      "section_path": [
        "Mac Catalyst",
        "Choose an idiom"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "1bc32ebf21f882a9f69058c40eb583b5ec50b2f3b4b562639e82da2b4c93a767",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Tab bars. A tab bar supports flat navigation by displaying top-level categories in a persistent bar at the bottom",
      "section_path": [
        "Mac Catalyst",
        "Integrate the Mac experience",
        "Navigation"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "1405c5cd326ff14ee2c4fc717308711c0afab8f96b5637a66a781769cee7a2a9",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Page controls. A page control displays dots at the bottom of the screen that indicate the position of the",
      "section_path": [
        "Mac Catalyst",
        "Integrate the Mac experience",
        "Navigation"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "0bf9e2b6d65fbef1818247df509613fa7a98171bf06580c260439a4b5391b27c",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Make sure people retain access to important tab-bar items in the Mac version of your app",
      "section_path": [
        "Mac Catalyst",
        "Integrate the Mac experience",
        "Navigation"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "245b68194d54c7325c116f9f191d7119f997025d3f2329278baf46eaf7cb3cac",
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "Offer multiple ways to move between pages",
      "section_path": [
        "Mac Catalyst",
        "Integrate the Mac experience",
        "Navigation"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "196331200e2857f5664350e29682a393cae8160e6ed02e810becc54de0bbdb4e",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "App icons",
      "section_path": [
        "Mac Catalyst",
        "Integrate the Mac experience",
        "App icons"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "3ffe846326f83f77d809c6f4f23e96099cad18c7d10bbf993c9f78c3fc5cff1a",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Create a macOS version of your app icon",
      "section_path": [
        "Mac Catalyst",
        "Integrate the Mac experience",
        "App icons"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "f7c0d03da2cf5f3c91ef9e3147d132ae474446352bf347bbcfd6e362c25103c2",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide a single column of content and actions into multiple columns",
      "section_path": [
        "Mac Catalyst",
        "Integrate the Mac experience",
        "Layout"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "9efd4b0f78090ca233fe5343317e8f45233bd0f171e15116b73ca4e4cc512419",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Use regular-width and regular-height size classes in the Mac app",
      "section_path": [
        "Mac Catalyst",
        "Integrate the Mac experience",
        "Layout"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "1aba56d187dbfd57fc7939788b75cf62e41ba89b5af816ad5168ed0671d2bcc1",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Present an inspector UI next to the main content instead of using a popover",
      "section_path": [
        "Mac Catalyst",
        "Integrate the Mac experience",
        "Layout"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "e5ff0925836880d79ceeb06b412366579376bb1838462f780f73d9fc3022bb9a",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "Consider moving controls from the main UI of your iPad app to your Mac app’s toolbar",
      "section_path": [
        "Mac Catalyst",
        "Integrate the Mac experience",
        "Layout"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "5bb2853fb752c409c377f599377c871dbccbcb92681c061f6c41f9ab72c69267",
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "As much as possible, adopt a top-down flow",
      "section_path": [
        "Mac Catalyst",
        "Integrate the Mac experience",
        "Layout"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "f396229453d2903a36240854870fbe42fa37d8240680e424df53ac82fc8500cb",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Relocate buttons from the side and bottom edges of the screen",
      "section_path": [
        "Mac Catalyst",
        "Integrate the Mac experience",
        "Layout"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "13750986f315b2ab18772f9e0225af71649737bf4ef2c06cb8f88b172bcebdff",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Support keyboard navigation and shortcuts in the Mac app",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Before you start"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "5500578783d7ba8c3f982892f8e03e2875129b55c988152f2db9d1ec43c86f51",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid Mac Catalyst when essential features depend on capabilities unavailable on Mac",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Before you start"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "b85732292698c397dcc21ce58b4985ab7e4851f47fd4bff901457bcbbf59055b",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Consider the Mac idiom after the iPad idiom feels at home on Mac",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Choose an idiom"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "b735270d6d39aa52b4ca19990b9ac41fafd9baf6c222f151a09ebb7a0700d073",
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Determine necessary layout changes when adopting the Mac idiom",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Choose an idiom"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "7a22d4bf0d947e2fc56190a864ab8624d5b2fa7678812f33aa2c1cf1596dbc9c",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Consider a separate asset catalog for Mac app assets",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Choose an idiom"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "7a22d4bf0d947e2fc56190a864ab8624d5b2fa7678812f33aa2c1cf1596dbc9c",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Change font sizes for the Mac idiom as needed",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Choose an idiom"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "d13de847d2e0cec97ac2131865198d6ba718b1851325f834a4bcc9582414ac22",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Use text styles wherever possible in the Mac idiom",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Choose an idiom"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "d13de847d2e0cec97ac2131865198d6ba718b1851325f834a4bcc9582414ac22",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid fixed font sizes in the Mac idiom",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Choose an idiom"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "d13de847d2e0cec97ac2131865198d6ba718b1851325f834a4bcc9582414ac22",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid fixed view and layout sizes in the Mac idiom",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Choose an idiom"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "7a7713d7f2b73e67b64203b2f06a70516dac75d4859d78fb0ed4e86df2ee83e8",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Use only standard macOS appearance customizations similar to iPadOS",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Choose an idiom"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "88ec696498b9c585717cf9f974a31ebbf87fffa3feb6b3249ea175693ff4a258",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Ensure a Mac Catalyst app provides a rich Mac experience",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Integrate the Mac experience"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "5e46bfaedcd9feea8b239f61c1051867655c5637ced528e09f3c02491cc949d5",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Identify the main iPadOS and macOS differences before updating views and controls",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Integrate the Mac experience"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "185fed6174fcdf3df06404651d8fb868b2365c2134e09cb08a66efb1e0f030f5",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Consider replacing an iPad tab bar with a Mac sidebar or segmented control",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Integrate the Mac experience", "Navigation"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "ed04d30bd592dfb14a02b09102af4c134cff61b36a734641db0356e15af4b9cb",
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Prefer a Mac split view unless the navigation hierarchy is flat",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Integrate the Mac experience", "Navigation"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "4b3e457f75a053dc234dbf54330b10298b664eac10b1eb8bbb7a5721e064e118",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Use multiple columns for Mac content and actions",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Integrate the Mac experience", "Layout"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "9efd4b0f78090ca233fe5343317e8f45233bd0f171e15116b73ca4e4cc512419",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Consider side-by-side content reflow while the Mac window resizes",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Integrate the Mac experience", "Layout"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "1aba56d187dbfd57fc7939788b75cf62e41ba89b5af816ad5168ed0671d2bcc1",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Be sure to list toolbar commands in Mac menu-bar menus",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Integrate the Mac experience", "Layout"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "5bb2853fb752c409c377f599377c871dbccbcb92681c061f6c41f9ab72c69267",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Place iPad toolbar controls in the Mac window toolbar",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Integrate the Mac experience", "Layout"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "f396229453d2903a36240854870fbe42fa37d8240680e424df53ac82fc8500cb",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Position Mac buttons away from side and bottom screen edges",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Integrate the Mac experience", "Layout"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "194d4cea08a54606e6cd59efe03fd81bc40fd07e062925319ca9a5a2ef11e803",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Provide all Mac app commands in the persistent menu bar",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Integrate the Mac experience", "Menus"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "8c7e555763363f1e799d70c7b3894047a6d6a739b206278bb37d96b4216f2f84",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Use UIKeyCommand to support keyboard shortcuts for menu commands",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Integrate the Mac experience", "Menus"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "d5df4117dcd0a0d2cf6ca7b378a9a7bfbe7b28ed879fe119ea134fde78967af3",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Use UIMenuBuilder and UICommand for custom Mac app menus",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Integrate the Mac experience", "Menus"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "48b3571450ac40f96d4a2452e5a1b124ad2429cb66d7a7a40d4617a2972ec6b3",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Consider additional Mac objects that could support context menus",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Integrate the Mac experience", "Menus"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "8af6d8578c9aadbfcf27239c99ca0504eb3f42dd394e57794e2fad822670fa90",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Provide relevant context-menu actions for suitable Mac objects",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Integrate the Mac experience", "Menus"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "8af6d8578c9aadbfcf27239c99ca0504eb3f42dd394e57794e2fad822670fa90",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid Mac Catalyst on unsupported Apple platforms",
      "section_path": ["Mac Catalyst", "Platform considerations"],
      "source_sentence_hash": "a1f9f5fc7c47fb7e1cd95d7a945df71e41a42269ab9011dc4f99df8721cdd049",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Developer documentation",
      "section_path": [
        "Mac Catalyst",
        "Resources",
        "Developer documentation"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "b985db6433c8e9669caebab194ee62b3b3af7505decd93ea111f546d714e1907",
      "word_count": 2
    }
  ],
